<section class="ingredients" id="ingredients">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">18味草本配伍，回归温和净养</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">源自《苗族医药学》18味苗家古方 · 科学配伍</p>
    <p class="section-subdesc">精选草本协同调理，兼顾清洁力与头皮舒适度。</p>
    
    <h3 class="foundation-title">🌱 养发根基</h3>
    <div class="ingredient-grid">
      <div class="ingredient-card">
        <div class="ingredient-img"><img src="{{ 'slide4_img11_14.png' | asset_url }}" alt="何首乌"></div>
        <h3>何首乌</h3>
        <p>滋养发根，改善干枯脆弱。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ingredient-card">
        <div class="ingredient-img"><img src="{{ 'slide4_img12_15.png' | asset_url }}" alt="桑葚"></div>
        <h3>桑葚</h3>
        <p>帮助平衡头皮环境。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ingredient-card">
        <div class="ingredient-img"><img src="{{ 'slide4_img13_16.png' | asset_url }}" alt="墨旱莲"></div>
        <h3>墨旱莲</h3>
        <p>舒缓头皮，提升韧性。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ingredient-card">
        <div class="ingredient-img"><img src="{{ 'slide4_img14_17.png' | asset_url }}" alt="侧柏叶"></div>
        <h3>侧柏叶</h3>
        <p>辅助净屑，维持清爽感。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.ingredients { padding: 80px 0; background: #f8f9f0; }
.section-subdesc { text-align: center; color: #888; font-size: 14px; margin-top: -10px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
.foundation-title {
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 22px;
  color: #4a7c3f;
  margin-bottom: 32px;
  padding-bottom: 16px;
  border-bottom: 2px solid #4a7c3f;
  display: inline-block;
  width: 100%;
}
.ingredient-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
  gap: 28px;
}
.ingredient-card {
  background: white;
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 28px 20px;
  text-align: center;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  transition: transform 0.3s;
}
.ingredient-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
.ingredient-img { margin-bottom: 16px; }
.ingredient-img img { width: 120px; height: 120px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; }
.ingredient-card h3 { font-size: 18px; color: #2d4a2a; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.ingredient-card p { font-size: 14px; color: #666; line-height: 1.6; }
</style>

{% schema %}{"name":"Ingredients","settings":[],"presets":[{"name":"Ingredients"}]}{% endschema %}
